00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.549
- What's up believe nation?

00:00:04.549 --> 00:00:07.169
It's Evan, my one word
is believe and I believe

00:00:07.169 --> 00:00:09.579
in people more than they
believe in themselves

00:00:09.579 --> 00:00:11.739
