00:00:11.739 --> 00:00:13.189
in you what I see in you,

00:00:13.189 --> 00:00:15.973
you'll be able to change the planet.

00:00:15.973 --> 00:00:18.168
I started the Mentor
Me series with the goal

00:00:18.168 --> 00:00:20.068
