00:00:20.068 --> 00:00:21.588
a lot more than us, to try to hang out

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:23.598
with people who've had
more success than us

00:00:23.598 --> 00:00:24.998
and hopefully some of their beliefs,

00:00:24.998 --> 00:00:27.268
some of their mindset, some
of their way of working

00:00:27.268 --> 00:00:28.778
seeps into us, to help us

00:00:28.778 --> 00:00:31.318
become the best version of ourselves.

00:00:31.318 --> 00:00:33.248
So today we're going to
learn from Floyd Mayweather

00:00:33.248 --> 00:00:35.748
and Conor McGregor and their motivation.

00:00:35.748 --> 00:00:37.628
