he was going to show up.

00:08:42.287 --> 00:08:44.739
And that's it. I don't know.

00:08:44.739 --> 00:08:46.489
I don't really think about that.

00:08:46.489 --> 00:08:47.322
- When you walk in here with the...

00:08:47.322 --> 00:08:48.989
- What I do know is,

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:52.508
I just know that it will live on.

00:08:52.508 --> 00:08:54.127
That's what I do know.

00:08:54.127 --> 00:08:57.660
I cannot control what
people say about me now,

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:59.729
or in the future.

00:08:59.729 --> 00:09:01.550
But I certainly know what I am doing,

00:09:01.550 --> 00:09:03.631
and the stuff that I am doing and achieved

00:09:03.631 --> 00:09:06.003
will live on long after I am gone.

00:09:06.003 --> 00:09:07.597
