and your career right now,

00:09:10.102 --> 00:09:10.935
- Yes.

00:09:12.219 --> 00:09:13.552
- Where are you?

00:09:15.957 --> 00:09:18.057
Just looking at the life
of Floyd Mayweather.

00:09:18.057 --> 00:09:19.657
- Just looking at my life,

00:09:19.657 --> 00:09:22.266
I don't think most people could handle

00:09:22.266 --> 00:09:23.766
being in my shoes.

00:09:25.992 --> 00:09:26.825
Yo, yo!

00:09:31.163 --> 00:09:33.082
I don't think, as of right now,

00:09:33.082 --> 00:09:37.376
I don't think no one
could handle my situation.

00:09:37.376 --> 00:09:38.856
- Why not?

00:09:38.856 --> 00:09:40.152
- They just can't.

00:09:40.152 --> 00:09:42.085
- What's your situation
that can't be handled?

00:09:42.085 --> 00:09:43.521
- I'm just saying that it's like,

00:09:43.521 --> 00:09:45.315
they feel like it's pressure on me.

00:09:45.315 --> 00:09:49.065
They try to defeat me
in many different ways.

00:09:49.952 --> 00:09:51.723
They try to bring up the tax thing,

00:09:51.723 --> 00:09:53.988
they try to bring up he's been locked up,

00:09:53.988 --> 00:09:56.051
he's arrogant, he's unappreciative.

00:09:56.051 --> 00:09:59.569
Years and years and
years they've been trying

00:09:59.569 --> 00:10:01.486
their best to defeat me

00:10:03.449 --> 00:10:05.072
mentally.

00:10:05.072 --> 00:10:06.372
I can't be defeated.

00:10:06.372 --> 00:10:08.142
I'm a strong individual.

00:10:08.142 --> 00:10:09.912
Nothing can throw me off,

00:10:09.912 --> 00:10:11.626
nothing can throw me off

00:10:11.626 --> 00:10:12.786
throw me off key.

00:10:12.786 --> 00:10:16.296
I'm always focused on what I've got to do.

00:10:16.296 --> 00:10:18.626
- And that's going to
be the case August 26th?

00:10:18.626 --> 00:10:21.256
- August 26th is going
to be real interesting.

00:10:21.256 --> 00:10:22.703
And I'm not backing up.

00:10:22.703 --> 00:10:23.994
Remember, I told you that.

00:10:23.994 --> 00:10:25.212
- You're not backing up?

00:10:25.212 --> 00:10:26.827
- I'm not backing up.

