But I knew.

00:11:36.779 --> 00:11:38.626
You know what I mean, I knew.

00:11:38.626 --> 00:11:41.666
I ended up getting a trade,
just to keep them quiet.

00:11:41.666 --> 00:11:43.491
I always used to have a
lot of fights with my dad.

00:11:43.491 --> 00:11:44.716
- What trade did you get?

00:11:44.716 --> 00:11:46.379
- I ended up getting a trade as a plumber.

00:11:46.379 --> 00:11:47.866
- How bad was that?

00:11:47.866 --> 00:11:48.699
- The plumbing?

00:11:48.699 --> 00:11:49.532
- Yeah.

00:11:49.532 --> 00:11:50.365
- Horrendous.

00:11:50.365 --> 00:11:52.140
- Were you actually in the trenches?

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.876
- It was in industrial, so I'd be like,

00:11:53.876 --> 00:11:56.057
building this, it'd be like the plumbing

00:11:56.057 --> 00:11:58.323
that would be needed in a place like this.

00:11:58.323 --> 00:11:59.667
6 o'clock in the morning.

00:11:59.667 --> 00:12:02.365
I used to have to walk for about an hour

00:12:02.365 --> 00:12:03.936
to get there on motorway.

00:12:03.936 --> 00:12:05.436
And then I'd stand on
the edge of the motorway

00:12:05.436 --> 00:12:07.419
and wait for a bloke to drive by

00:12:07.419 --> 00:12:08.573
so he'd give me a lift.

00:12:08.573 --> 00:12:10.567
And then the motorway was getting

00:12:10.567 --> 00:12:12.251
renovation at the time,
so it would take me

00:12:12.251 --> 00:12:13.515
2 hours, 2 and a half hours

00:12:13.515 --> 00:12:14.865
to get to the place, it
was out in the country

00:12:14.865 --> 00:12:16.605
and I'd be there for ten hours, working.

00:12:16.605 --> 00:12:18.875
And I was a first year, so I was the worst

00:12:18.875 --> 00:12:20.835
of the worst, I was only a beginner.

00:12:20.835 --> 00:12:23.655
Then two hours to get
back in the traffic again.

00:12:23.655 --> 00:12:25.315
Which is a horrible, horrible time.

00:12:25.315 --> 00:12:26.515
And I was like, you know what,

00:12:26.515 --> 00:12:28.045
I don't want to do this,
and then I just left.

00:12:28.045 --> 00:12:30.345
I lasted 18 months doing it.

00:12:30.345 --> 00:12:33.845
It was tough and it
wasn't the life for me.

00:12:33.845 --> 00:12:35.780
And then John said, 'cause I was training

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:37.561
with John as well at the time,

00:12:37.561 --> 00:12:39.691
and then John got on Twitch and says,

00:12:39.691 --> 00:12:41.231
"I have a show, I'm in a show

00:12:41.231 --> 00:12:42.283
and I'd like you to fight in it."

00:12:42.283 --> 00:12:43.324
And then that was it.

00:12:43.324 --> 00:12:44.838
I just packed it in, didn't show up.

00:12:44.838 --> 00:12:46.185
My da used to come in and punch the hell

00:12:46.185 --> 00:12:48.187
out of me, try and drag me out of bed,

00:12:48.187 --> 00:12:49.501
and I just wouldn't go.

00:12:49.501 --> 00:12:52.498
Had an hoopla for a good
few years with him over it.

00:12:52.498 --> 00:12:55.738
And that was it, I just
packed it in, quit,

00:12:55.738 --> 00:12:57.788
and then focused on training.

00:12:57.788 --> 00:12:59.438
I knew what was going to happen.

00:12:59.438 --> 00:13:01.338
I knew I was going to
get here, they didn't.

00:13:01.338 --> 00:13:03.198
It was a lot of stressful years.

00:13:03.198 --> 00:13:04.948
A lot of tough times.

00:13:06.216 --> 00:13:09.378
But I proved them wrong,
I proved myself right.

00:13:09.378 --> 00:13:13.518
Everything I do in my
life is related to this.

00:13:13.518 --> 00:13:15.288
I don't do nothing else if it's not

00:13:15.288 --> 00:13:17.504
got to do with fighting, know what I mean?

00:13:17.504 --> 00:13:19.035
That is why

00:13:19.035 --> 00:13:21.978
All you've got to do is show up.

00:13:21.978 --> 00:13:23.645
- Is that unhealthy?

00:13:24.756 --> 00:13:26.866
I don't know, do I look unhealthy?

00:13:26.866 --> 00:13:28.306
Take a look at this physique.

00:13:28.306 --> 00:13:30.738
I'm in phenomenal shape, in body and mind.

00:13:30.738 --> 00:13:33.320
To me what's unhealthy is
living an unhealthy life.

00:13:33.320 --> 00:13:34.799
To me what's unhealthy is getting up

00:13:34.799 --> 00:13:35.984
and going through the same day,

00:13:35.984 --> 00:13:37.322
every day of your life 9 to 5

00:13:37.322 --> 00:13:40.221
in an office, that's unhealthy.

00:13:40.221 --> 00:13:42.017
That beats your mind.

00:13:42.017 --> 00:13:44.600
I don't work, I love what I do.

00:13:45.617 --> 00:13:47.667
And that's why I'm doing what I love.

00:13:47.667 --> 00:13:49.487
That's why it's become a career for me

00:13:49.487 --> 00:13:52.145
because I love it, I love what I do.

00:13:52.145 --> 00:13:53.657
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:13:53.657 --> 00:13:54.717
I hope you enjoyed.

00:13:54.717 --> 00:13:56.267
I'd love to know what did you learn

00:13:56.267 --> 00:13:58.137
from this video, what clips spoke the most

00:13:58.137 --> 00:13:59.747
to you, and how are you going to apply it

00:13:59.747 --> 00:14:02.857
immediately, somehow in your
life, or in your business.

00:14:02.857 --> 00:14:04.917
Please leave it down
in the comments below.

00:14:04.917 --> 00:14:06.150
Also, if you're leaving a comment within

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:08.357
the first few hours of
this video going live,

00:14:08.357 --> 00:14:10.767
you have a chance to win
one of two daily prizes.

00:14:10.767 --> 00:14:12.027
I also want to give a quick shout out

00:14:12.027 --> 00:14:14.074
to Louis Lopez from
The Better Men Project,

00:14:14.074 --> 00:14:15.674
Louis, thank you so much for picking up

00:14:15.674 --> 00:14:17.384
a copy of my book, "Your One Word"

00:14:17.384 --> 00:14:19.564
and doing the review on
your YouTube channel.

00:14:19.564 --> 00:14:21.664
I really, really appreciate
the support, man,

00:14:21.664 --> 00:14:23.422
and I'm so glad you enjoyed my book.

00:14:23.422 --> 00:14:26.272
- [Narrator] If you
could describe yourself

00:14:26.272 --> 00:14:27.512
with one word, what would it be?

00:14:27.512 --> 00:14:29.284
- Thank you guys again for watching.

00:14:29.284 --> 00:14:30.272
I believe in you.

00:14:30.272 --> 00:14:32.218
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself,

00:14:32.218 --> 00:14:34.429
and whatever your one word is.

00:14:34.429 --> 00:14:36.846
Much love, I'll see you soon.

